// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Buck_Salinger 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Buck Salinger 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P554738325" "Buck Salinger"
// ProfessionString :
"P2013231913" "Midnight Squad Researcher"
// DescriptionString :
"P2521174853" "The Midnight Squad is but a shadow of its former self, but you wouldn't know it to hear Buck Salinger's stories.  Buck loves re-living the glory days, when the Midnight Squad was Paragon City's first line of defense against any and all mystical evils.  Buck's not afraid of what's under the bed, what's hiding in the closet, or what's slinking through the shadowed lanes of Croatoa.  His maverick attitude has gotten him in trouble with his bosses in the past, but even they have to admit, Buck knows his stuff and he's got the gumption to see the job through to the finish."
// HelloString :
"P3832102421" "You ready to bust some heads?"
// HelloString :
"P1825966592" "We got work to do, slick.  Let's get to it."
// HelloString :
"P3836721880" "It's time to get it in gear."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3160104497" "We haven't met, partner.  You should look up {LastContactName} instead."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1240312306" "Some people say I'm reckless.  Some people say I'm washed up.  But listen to me, {HeroName}, and listen good: I will get you the information you need to save these people.  And I will give you the support you need to come back alive."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1890482029" "I've got nothing to give you, kid.  Maybe you should check with your other contacts."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P826445625" "You've got a pretty full plate to be looking for more work."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1445793172" "I'm not about to let you walk into a situation you're not prepared for.  Get to Security Level {Level}.  Then we'll talk."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1174634595" "If you keep up this pace, kid, we might turn out to be friends.  Take a look at these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements;</a> and call on me at any time."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P888941171" "I'd say we've achieved a certain level of trust, you and I.  Need any more <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements?</a> I want you to be prepared out there."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P917331404" "Look, you've grown beyond me, kid, and there's no use pretending you haven't.  I know there are greater challenges in store for you."
// LocationString :
"P3310090529" "Croatoa"
// IntroString :
"P2557957271" "Buck Salinger's an old Midnight Squad researcher and he really knows his stuff.  He can get you Magic and Natural Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2685352171" "Choose Buck Salinger"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1269227159" "Buck's brusque, but he's committed.  He will do everything in his power to help you."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1689353757" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Someone</a> I know could use your help.  <color orange>But you should also see if you can be of help to Katie Hannon.  You can find her in Sunset Ridge</color>."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P243108521" "A couple of people I know could use your help.  <color orange>But you should also see if you can be of help to Katie Hannon. You can find her in Sunset Ridge</color>."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


