// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Gordon_Bower 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Gordon Bower 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1821827617" "Gordon Bower"
// ProfessionString :
"P2293491219" "Salamanca Mayor"
// DescriptionString :
"P2312155570" "You might say Gordon Bower inherited the family business.  His father, Tom Bower, was mayor of Salamanca for more than thirty years, and spearheaded most of the projects that turned the community into a peaceful and picturesque tourist resort.  Gordon's proud of that history.  When he was elected last year, he certainly never expected a malevolent mystical force to threaten his family's accomplishments.  Now, Gordon feels he must assume the responsibility for saving his town from the unearthly forces that bind it to Croatoa.  After all, his father would have done so."
// HelloString :
"P152829613" "We've got a village to save."
// HelloString :
"P3469602591" "Salamanca is counting on you."
// HelloString :
"P1237596707" "I really need your help."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3384801228" "I don't believe we've met.  Perhaps you should speak to {LastContactName} instead."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4275824415" "My home is in trouble, {HeroName}.  I hope you can help me save it."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2724729597" "You've worked wonders for Salamanca, {HeroName}.  Perhaps your other contacts have need of you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P153909247" "Saving Salamanca is serious business, and it looks like you've already got far too much on your hands."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3800673463" "Things are deadly around here.  I don't think you should get involved until you reach Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3827447644" "You're becoming a true friend to Salamanca, {HeroName}.  I want to help you in any way I can.  Please, look at these <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a> Oh, and call any time."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2101599684" "{HeroName}, there is no one I trust more than you.  I hope these new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> can help you."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3073882519" "I've got things covered around here.  I'm sure there are other people who need your assistance more."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3008982302" "Gordon Bower's a man with a problem.  A big one.  His village, Salamanca, seems to be under some sort of mystical curse.  Gordon can provide you with Magic and Natural Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1623681444" "Choose Gordon Bower"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2273185865" "Gordon's doing his best in Salamanca, but he really needs your help."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P22777674" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Skipper</a> tells me that he's got more work for you, if you're willing.  He's a little weird sometimes, but I have to admit, he knows his stuff."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P856364347" ""
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


