// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Katie_Hannon 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Katie Hannon 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1697420006" "Katie Hannon"
// ProfessionString :
"P1709729969" "Youngest Sorceress"
// DescriptionString :
"P3351319340" "Though Katie is the youngest of all the sorceresses, she's lived in Croatoa for more than two centuries.  Her youthful outlook and sunny disposition give hope to her people, making them believe that they can someday triumph over the ghoulish Red Caps."
// DontHaveToken :
"P4013681585" "I don't talk to strangers.  Maybe if you learned about my home, we could get to know one another."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P1391587719" "Hi!  I guess you know by now that we sorceresses have been fighting with the Red Caps for a long time.  A long, long time.  Ever since they came to our settlement in Roanoke, back in 1588.  That was shortly after the Fir Bolg came to our lands.  They were running away from their enemies in Ireland, the Tuatha de Dannan.  We formed a cautious friendship, but we had no idea that the Red Caps had followed them all the way across the sea! <br><br>They trapped us here, killed all the men, and watched our suffering for the last four hundred years!  And we finally found a way to get rid of them! <br><br>But if you really think the spell we're going to use may hurt other magic life, you might be able to convince our leader to change her plans.  Of course, it won't be easy.  My elders have had several centuries to harden their hearts against outsiders. <br><br><A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you can defeat our leader, Mary Macomber, we'll listen to what you have to say.</A> Otherwise, we'll go ahead with our plan."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P451233643" "Sorry, but I'm scared you'd get hurt around here.  Why don't you come back when you're Level 30? <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 6 members on your team, all of them at least Level 30.  If they are over Level 34, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 34 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P15228831" "Gosh, you're strong!  I think you're probably needed elsewhere. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 6 members on your team, all of them at least Level 30.  If they are over Level 34, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 34 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P2058865419" "You should come back with at least 5 friends. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 6 members on your team, all of them at least Level 30.  If they are over Level 34, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 34 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P4124651680" "Is everybody here?  No?  Let's wait for them."
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P180040400" "Are you the team leader?  That's who I should talk to."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P1364711798" "Some of you aren't right for this job.  I need heroes between Level 30 and Level 34. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 6 members on your team, all of them at least Level 30.  If they are over Level 34, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 34 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// DontHaveToken :
"P1419413395" "I don't think I should be talking to you.  But maybe if you find out more about my home we could be friends."
// TaskForceName :
"P2450020000" "Task Force Rue"
// TaskForceName :
"P2690840150" "Task Force Fennel"
// TaskForceName :
"P1234134135" "Task Force Marjoram"
// TaskForceName :
"P4290680733" "Task Force Cinnamon"
// TaskForceName :
"P367409984" "Task Force Anise"
// TaskForceName :
"P1236764075" "Task Force Chervil"
// TaskForceName :
"P1688653760" "Task Force Caraway"
// HelloString :
"P1031429891" "Hi!"
// HelloString :
"P3840651449" "I hope you can help."
// HelloString :
"P2773376751" "We've got a big job to do."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P90479089" "I'm not supposed to talk to strangers.  Why don't you talk to {LastContactName}?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P1277405767" "Things are pretty scary around here.  Do you think you can help me?  I think you can."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P296961761" "Things are still pretty scary here in Croatoa.  If you'd like to help me again, I'd like that."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1214861731" "We're friends, right?  I really believe in you guys.  Keep in touch!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3529286638" "You are the best heroes I've ever seen!"
// FailsafeLevelString :
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1223851780" "You should introduce yourself to Katie Hannon.  She knows quite a bit about the Cabal."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1708033223" "Choose Katie Hannon"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3533800012" "Katie seems young, but she's actually quite a bit older than me."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P110741868" "There's someone I'd like you to meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1540136256" "There are some people I'd like you to meet."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


