// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Skipper_LeGrange 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Skipper LeGrange 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2623510491" "Skipper LeGrange"
// ProfessionString :
"P4049333901" "Ghost Hunter"
// DescriptionString :
"P3546667061" "Skipper LeGrange knows that quite a few folks think he's crazy.  He also knows that he's not.  After more than ten years spent on the trail of some of the most devilish spirits on the North American continent, Skipper knows what goes bump in the night.  In some ways, Croatoa is a golden opportunity for him.  Skipper's had a hard time resisting the urge to invite his old professors, employers, and girlfriends up to Croatoa to see how real the supernatural really is.  He did, however, invite his mom."
// HelloString :
"P1457344023" "Howdy, {HeroName}.  You ready to toast some ghosts?"
// HelloString :
"P324233069" "Let's get cracking!"
// HelloString :
"P308016505" "We've got a lot to learn around here, {HeroName}. Let's get to it."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P4160952274" "I don't think I know you.  You better talk to {LastContactName} instead."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3802429916" "I'm glad you've decided to join me in holding the line against this maelstrom of unearthly might.  It's not everyone who's fit for a job like this.  No, sir."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4120506541" "You've done it all, {HeroName}.  Maybe your other contacts have something for you to learn."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2036690133" "The supernatural isn't for the casual adventurer, {HeroName}.  You should come back when you have your plate clear."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3757182506" "Sure, I know something, but it's dangerous.  Wicked dangerous.  Maybe when you're Security Level {Level}, we'll talk."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4207879651" "You and me, we're buds, right?  Fellow adventurers on a path of preternatural peril.  You need some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements,</a> I'm your man!  So call on me!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4004420902" "We've gone through fire together, {HeroName}.  If I can <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>help</a> you in any way, I want to."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P756581115" "Nothing exciting going on around here.  Not for a hero like you."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1680076190" "You've met Skipper.  If you can work with him, I know he'll get you the information you need to save my village.  He's also got access to Magic and Natural Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3063914245" "Choose Skipper LeGrange"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3260316365" "Skipper's a good kid.  I believe he'll steer you right."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1033657802" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Chick</a> I know would like to meet you.  Well, not a chick, exactly.  It's complicated."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


