// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P41739984" "War Witch"
// ProfessionString :
"P776652839" "Guardian of Croatoa"
// DescriptionString :
"P516744723" "War Witch is a powerful sorceress who channels the mystic powers of her coven to battle villains. Years ago she teamed up with fellow heroes Horus and Apex, but events conspired to split the group apart.<br><br>War Witch projects herself astrally here in Croatoa to commune with ancient and powerful spirits. Floating silently by the lake she is happy to train younger heroes in need."
// HelloString :
// SubContactsDisplay :
"P2272058994" "Train to a new level of power"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3083194123" "I can give you a few pointers. You learn a few things only after the fact."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4064472357" "Hey, take a load off. Let's chat."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P46741529" "I may just be an astral projection, but that doesn't mean I can't teach you a thing or two."
// LocationString :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

